    {
      "id": "salon.genuine_joke",
      "speaker": "maris_quell",
      "text": "Then Observatory publishes anyway and I spend a month in rooms where everyone smiles with knives. I'd rather that than watch a bad schedule become law because I was polite at a party. You're still here. That's either loyalty or poor time management.",
