      "id": "salon.genuine_seen",
      "speaker": "maris_quell",
      "text": "That's either true or a high-end fake. I'll allow both until the night proves it. For the record: I almost opened by mocking Voss's cufflinks. Petty. Accurate. I killed it because I need him to underestimate me until after the toast.",
